    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "提供籃球運動的基本知識與規則,提高個人攻守的技術,培養籃球運動的興趣",
      "describe_en": " Offer basketball ABC and rule of a movement.\nImprove the technology that individual offends and defends.\nTrain the interest of the basketball movement."
